- Renames `de-corona` folder to `corona-charts`. So all corona related charts can be added in this folder. This makes automating more corona charts easier, because the Github Actions configuration can just be extended.
- Sets up Github Actions to be able to run R scripts
- Adds `owid_vaccinations_worldwide` folder with script for data update of [the impffortschritt custom chart](https://q.st.nzz.ch/item/79af3c6593df15827ccb5268a7aff0be)
- Adds a `helpers.R` file which contains the `update_chart`-function to update the `q.config.json` file used by Q-Cli to update Q charts

